## `smtp`

Outgoing mail.

| Key | Description | Type | Default | Env | Flag | Used by |
|-----|-------------|------|---------|-----|------|---------|
| `smtp.host` | SMTP server host. | string |  | `ZP_SMTP_HOST` | `--smtp-host` | Serve, TestEmail, Notify |
| `smtp.port` | SMTP server port. | int | `587` | `ZP_SMTP_PORT` | `--smtp-port` | Serve, TestEmail, Notify |
| `smtp.tls` | Use implicit TLS. | bool |  | `ZP_SMTP_TLS` | `--smtp-tls` | Serve, TestEmail, Notify |

## Rules

- At most one of `auth.token`, `auth.keys` is set.
- `server.tls.cert` only matters when `server.tls.enabled` is set.

